{"title":"45","section":"1344","heading":"Status of Conrail after sale","lead":"The Corporation shall be a rail carrier as defined in section 10102 of title 49, notwithstanding this subchapter.","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"editorialNotes","text":"Editorial Notes"},{"topic":"amendments","text":"Amendments1995—Pub. L. 104–88 substituted “section 10102” for “section 10102(19)”."},{"topic":"statutoryNotes","text":"Statutory Notes and Related Subsidiaries"},{"topic":"effectiveDateOfAmendment","text":"Effective Date of 1995 AmendmentAmendment by Pub. L. 104–88 effective Jan. 1, 1996, see section 2 of Pub. L. 104–88, set out as an Effective Date note under section 1301 of Title 49, Transportation."}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 99–509, title IV, § 4036, Oct. 21, 1986, 100 Stat. 1909; Pub. L. 104–88, title III, § 332, Dec. 29, 1995, 109 Stat. 953.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 45—","heading":"RAILROADS","identifier":"/us/usc/t45"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 22—","heading":"CONRAIL PRIVATIZATION","identifier":"/us/usc/t45/ch22"},{"type":"subchapter","num":"SUBCHAPTER II—","heading":"CONRAIL","identifier":"/us/usc/t45/ch22/schII"},{"type":"part","num":"Part C—","heading":"Miscellaneous Provisions","identifier":"/us/usc/t45/ch22/schII/ptC"}]}